WEBVTT

00:09:58.742 --> 00:10:01.236
(Laughter)

00:10:02.266 --> 00:10:04.144
And I also felt like

00:10:04.168 --> 00:10:08.593
I'd had this really unusual
philosophical privilege

00:10:08.617 --> 00:10:11.281
to understand love.

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:16.650
The lab offered to 3D-print my caudate.

00:10:17.358 --> 00:10:19.431
I got to hold love in my hand.

00:10:19.455 --> 00:10:20.822
(Laughter)

00:10:21.201 --> 00:10:22.368
And then I bronzed it,

00:10:22.392 --> 00:10:25.863
and I made it into a necklace and sold
it at the merch table at my shows.

00:10:25.887 --> 00:10:28.669
(Laughter)

00:10:28.693 --> 00:10:35.040
(Applause)